# Route: guide 26 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 49 to
# 51, 23 quests, 1.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale, Tirisfal Glades): Booty Bay -> Mistvale Valley ->
# Nek'mani Wellspring -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Jaguero Isle -> Booty Bay
# -> Brightwater Lake -> Brill -> The Bulwark.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Monogrammed Sash (8552;
# Mok'rash 50); Facing Negolash (618; Negolash 52); Facing Negolash (8554;
# Negolash 52); Message in a Bottle (630; King Mukla 51).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288).

